{"c":"ADT 2017 Q4","e":"adt","d":"2017-03-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeff Likosar","x":"The second point is to date, we haven't really realized any material benefit in equipment costs, and we have opportunities as we go into 2018 and beyond to add equipment cost savings on top of the other things that we've had helping us in 2016, 2017.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/03/15/adt-inc-adt-q4-2017-earnings-conference-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2018 Q4","e":"adt","d":"2019-03-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim DeVries","x":"As we mentioned earlier that the 80% of market that doesn't have professional monitored, professional installed equipment and so the play for us is really focused on the growth side more than the cost takeout.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/11/adt-corporation-adt-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2018 Q4","e":"adt","d":"2019-03-11","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jim DeVries","x":"We're pleased to share that during our first year as a public company, we exceeded our initial 2018 financial outlook while raising guidance during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/11/adt-corporation-adt-q4-2018-earnings-conference-ca.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2019 Q1","e":"adt","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James D. DeVries","x":"The exposure as a result of the tariffs are de minimis for us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/adt-inc-adt-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2019 Q1","e":"adt","d":"2019-05-07","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Toni Kaplan","x":"And then my second question, just given that China tariffs are in the news again, can you remind us what kind of risk you see there, like basically what percent of your cost come from suppliers that might ultimately source their products from China?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/adt-inc-adt-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2019 Q1","e":"adt","d":"2019-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James D. DeVries","x":"In summary, our year is off to a great start and we are reaffirming the full-year guidance ranges we shared during our March call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/08/adt-inc-adt-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2019 Q3","e":"adt","d":"2019-11-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Likosar","x":"I was just mentioning earlier to -- in response to Gary's question that there's a whole variety of factors that has enabled us to maintain our guidance even not having Canada and the results for the last couple of months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/adt-corporation-adt-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2019 Q3","e":"adt","d":"2019-11-12","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Likosar","x":"And then some of that is the reason that we're able to maintain our guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/adt-corporation-adt-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcri.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2020 Q2","e":"adt","d":"2020-08-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeff Likosar","x":"…more demand for peace of mind, fewer relocations, has led our sales to residential customers and retention of those customers to remain strong, which goes into us being in a position, even despite the COVID-19 dynamics affecting commercial to have raised our guidance in the period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/adt-inc-adt-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ADT 2021 Q1","e":"adt","d":"2021-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Don Young","x":"Everything from verifying, location information at the timing of alarm event, video verification, a number of data streaming that we are using Google's Cloud to provide us to be able to provide a real-time exploring mechanism to live up to that standard.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/adt-inc-adt-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2021 Q1","e":"adt","d":"2021-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Mcveigh","x":"I guess, just how should we think about to be relative to the reaffirmed guidance as we work our way through the balance of '21?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/05/adt-inc-adt-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2021 Q2","e":"adt","d":"2021-08-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Likosar","x":"As we look to the rest of the year, we are maintaining the full year outlook ranges we shared in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/adt-inc-adt-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q2","e":"adt","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Likosar","x":"I will note that the timing of marketing expenses, working capital flows, cash interest, and potential tariffs will affect our second half relative to the first.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/adt-adt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q2","e":"adt","d":"2025-07-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jeff Likosar","x":"Despite ongoing uncertainty as to the exact amounts, we continue to believe we can absorb our tariff exposure within our full-year guidance ranges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/adt-adt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q2","e":"adt","d":"2025-07-24","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jeff Likosar","x":"We are therefore reaffirming our full-year guidance ranges for total revenue, adjusted EBITDA, and adjusted free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/24/adt-adt-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q3","e":"adt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James DeVries","x":"And we are working closely with our suppliers to mitigate our tariff exposure, which we do not expect to be material during 2025.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/adt-adt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q3","e":"adt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"James DeVries","x":"Despite some ongoing macroeconomic uncertainty, including tariff pressures and elevated interest rates, ADT's business model remains resilient and very well positioned for the future.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/adt-adt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q3","e":"adt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James DeVries","x":"We also introduced new automation and AI-driven testing capabilities to streamline app development, reduce the need for manual testing and deliver faster, high-quality releases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/adt-adt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q3","e":"adt","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James DeVries","x":"AI-driven cost savings are beginning to materialize, particularly in our call center operations and we expect to provide more quantitative detail as these benefits scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/adt-adt-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q4","e":"adt","d":"2026-03-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jeff Likosar","x":"I mentioned around $50,000,000 between technology in product, IT, and AI related, particularly some marketing investments, also the tariff headwind.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/02/adt-adt-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ADT 2025 Q4","e":"adt","d":"2026-03-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jim DeVries","x":"We are investing in customer service and artificial intelligence, as well as our related IT infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-t